2.1.2 Religious affiliation of the resident population of Kicukiro district
In Kicukiro district, Christianity is the predominant religion : 35.82% are catholic,
22.91% are ADEPR, 10.35 % are protestant, 9.97 % are Adventists , other Christians
represent 9.98% . O ther religious represented are Muslim ( 3.96%) and Jehovah
witness are (1.07%) while 2.7% of the resident population declared themselves to be
without religion. The table below displays details.

